Hi,

I am an amateur Lojban learner (and a beginner at that). Since I
thought I knew enough Lojban to construct simple sentences, I wanted
to write something in Lojban. I sent a couple of e-mail messages to my
friends in Lojban, but since most of them don't understand Lojban, I
endend up including an English translation as well.

To spare my friends of incomprehensible messages, I decided to start
writing small journal entries in Lojban. I am going to host them at
http://lambda.mit.edu/jboselfinti. I invite you to make any
suggestions or point out any errors.

Thanks
Anand


